<a name="firebirdauth"/><h1>Authentication/Encryption Options</h1>

<p>When using the Firebird protocol, there are several options for controlling which users are allowed to access an instance of SQL Relay.</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="firebirdprotoconnectstringsauth.html">Connect Strings Auth</a></li>
  <li><a href="firebirdprotouserlistauth.html">User List Auth</a></li>
</ul>

<p>When using the Firebird protocol, the following encryption options are available:</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="firebirdprotowirecrypt.html">Wire Encryption</a></li>
</ul>

